Author: AzaharPing contributors

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: AzaharPing

Summary: Ping to your Azahar multiplayer room

Description: |
  Shows the round-trip time to your Azahar multiplayer
  room on the top screen. Press Select to set the room
  address once. Runs only inside the Azahar emulator.

Compatibility: Citra

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
